rp_want="rpi::a_firmware_that_rounds_the_clock_under_the_request_is_put_back_and_refused rpi::a_range_that_cannot_move_is_not_an_actuator rpi::a_rate_outside_the_firmwares_range_is_refused_before_it_is_posted rpi::a_throttle_the_firmware_does_not_apply_is_refused "
